acceptance_criteria:
- Kernel-swarm harness runs on CI runner within 45m for full matrix of 6 kernels x 4 sequence profiles and reports per-kernel p50/p95 latency and token/sec;
- Prefill probe can replay a saved trace (from production trace anonymized corpus) and a synthetic strided-attention workload and produce consistent golden metrics within +/-5% of golden baseline;
- Two CI perf gates added: (a) PR-level smoke with p95 sentinel (10% slack) and (b) nightly regression detector with historical quantile comparison and automatic ticket creation if delta > 7%;
- Telemetry exported with these tags: kernel_id, seq_profile, batch_size, model_family, run_seed; metrics consumed by runtime-1.20 perf dashboard;
- Integration docs and a runnable example script included in the repo;
- No test flakes > 2% over 10 nightly runs.
